    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Read the Room.</strong> You have an instinctive feel for the emotional geometry of conversations.</p><ul><li>When you make an <strong>Insight (Soul)</strong> or <strong>Perception (Mind)</strong> check to gauge mood, detect Stealth, or sense the underlying stakes of a scene, you can add a d4 to the roll.</li><li>You can use this feature after you roll but before the GM tells you whether you succeed. Uses per Soma Break equal to your Soul modifier (minimum once).</li></ul><p>(The Active Effect below also gives you a small numeric edge on Insight (Soul) and Perception (Mind) checks.)</p>",
